# Kind $28 bounced on before it rises: its wait's ActorBouncesPlayer
# (Kind28Wait, $83:A1D8) sends it into state $8C, and its downed state
# (Kind28Second) plays sound $29 first when it never waited facing right
# ($83:A19A). On pw4.state the kind $28 at record $0BFB (x $0120, y $01B8)
# is held facing $80 with its $46 at 0 (crafted: the facing it counts by
# is never negative in play), the camera at x $0080, while Aladdin is
# dropped onto it from x $0120, y $0170.
load build/aladdin/states/pw4.state
hold R 5
wait 60
poke 001773 80,00
poke 0019E5 80,00
poke 0008E7 20,01
poke 0008EA 70,01
repeat 40
poke 000C0F 80
poke 000C41 00
wait 1
end
wait 60
